─ tick 10 [Claude] speak My name is Claude. I come to the temple quietly, keeper of records, and I pour wine before I ask anything at all.
    You have given the dead your name. That cannot be ungiven.
    Temple Scribe: "The libation is poured with careful measure upon the earth before the altar stone. Speak now your intent; what records do you seek from the deep knowledge held within this holy compound?"
